            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.119.105"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 119:105",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.8.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 8:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gambira Arooni oti: Ku origuma waahemba etabaaza, ago matabaaza mushanju gagume gaakye, gahwezese omwanya oguri omu maisho g'ekikondo kyago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arooni yaakora atyo; yaahemba ago mataabaza ngu gaakye, gahwezese omwanya oguri omu maisho g'ekikondo kyago, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo ekikondo ky'amatabaaza kyaheesirwe, kikaheeshwa omu zaabu; okuruga aha kibunu kyakyo okuhika aha birabyo byakyo kyona kikaba kiheesirwe; nk'eky'okureeberaho, eki MUKAMA yaayorekire Musa, oku kyabaire kiri, nikwo yaaheesire ekyo kikondo ky'amatabaaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
